    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Rate schedule PAL is a balancing service, therefore, quantities are excluded as associated Dths used for balancing&#160; do not represent gas delivered.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">ONEOK Northern Border Pipeline Company Holdings, L.L.C. is an indirect subsidiary of ONEOK, Inc. For additional information, refer to Note 1 of the Notes to the Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">TC PipeLines, LP is an indirect subsidiary of TC Energy Corporation. For additional information, refer to Note 1 of the Notes to the Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">As stated in the Northern Border Pipeline Company General Partnership Agreement and Note 1 of the Notes to the Financial Statements, each partner company has a number of votes on the Management Committee equal to the percentage interest hel by the partner company in the Partnership. Each partner designates two members and TC PipeLines, LP designates one of its members as chairman. The Management Committee has authority over the activities of the Partnership similar to the authority of the Board of Directors of a corporation.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-18" id="fn-18" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">ONEOK Northern Border Pipeline Company Holdings, L.L.C. is an indirect subsidiary of ONEOK, Inc. For additional information, refer to Note 1 of the Notes to the Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-19" id="fn-19" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">TC PipeLines, LP is an indirect subsidiary of TC Energy Corporation. For additional information, refer to Note 1 of the Notes to the Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-20" id="fn-20" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Des Plaines project has no active contracts.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes $53,661 for current year amortization of right of use operating leases and $149,412 for the retirement of the right of use asset.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-22" id="fn-22" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Accumulated Provision for Depreciation for general plant includes $50,771 for right of use operating leases. See note to Financial Statements.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The fixed asset method is used.</link:footnote>
